{#-
  ════════ BITCOIN'S PRICE: THE COMPACT SWITCH ════════

  The two scenarios as one compact switch (DEFAULTS_POLICY_2026-10-11 PR B,
  JM 2026-10-11): Compare Retirement Plans and the Stress Test, where one
  figure per scenario would have to speak for two plans or for a crash, so
  the options carry the titles and tags but no number. The page fills the
  "other" line with the other scenario's answer, so both stay on screen.
  Same words and same clicks as the block (components/price-cases.njk):
  PriceCases.renderSwitch fills it, PriceCases.bind reports picks.

  Usage, with an id unique on the page:
      {% set pcs_id = 'pcsCrp' %}
      {% include 'components/price-cases-switch.njk' %}
  Optional: pcs_class.

  Own scoped <style>, every rule under .pcs; colours as vars with literal
  fallbacks (host palettes differ).
-#}
{%- set pcsId = pcs_id | default('pcsSwitch') -%}
<style>
.pcs { margin: 0 0 1.1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1rem 0.8rem; border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.32); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(212,168,67,0.04); text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box; }
.pcs .pcs-head { font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text, #e8e0d0); margin: 0 0 0.6rem; }
.pcs .pcs-eyebrow { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold, #d4a843); margin-right: 0.5rem; }
.pcs .pcs-head strong { color: var(--text, #e8e0d0); }
.pcs .pcs-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: stretch; }
.pcs .pcs-opt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.3rem; width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; font: inherit; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.22); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 8px; transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s; }
.pcs .pcs-opt:hover { border-color: rgba(224,148,34,0.5); }
.pcs .pcs-opt.active { background: rgba(224,148,34,0.09); border-color: var(--amber, #e09422); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--amber, #e09422); }
.pcs .pcs-opt:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--amber, #e09422); outline-offset: 2px; }
.pcs .pcs-opt.is-muted .pcs-title { opacity: 0.8; }
.pcs .pcs-title { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--text, #e8e0d0); }
.pcs .pcs-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem 0.5rem; }
.pcs .pcs-tag { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
.pcs .pcs-tag--cons { color: #b9c7d2; background: rgba(185,199,210,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(185,199,210,0.3); }
.pcs .pcs-tag--hist { color: var(--gold, #d4a843); background: rgba(212,168,67,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.35); }
.pcs .pcs-tag--never { color: #cf9a8a; background: rgba(207,154,138,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(207,154,138,0.3); }
.pcs .pcs-state { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--amber, #e09422); white-space: nowrap; }
.pcs .pcs-opt:not(.active) .pcs-state-on, .pcs .pcs-opt.active .pcs-state-off { display: none; }
.pcs .pcs-note { font-size: 0.76rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-dim, #a89f8f); }
.pcs .pcs-or { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gold, #d4a843); padding: 0 0.1rem; }
.pcs .pcs-other { font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-dim, #a89f8f); margin: 0.6rem 0 0; }
.pcs .pcs-other strong { color: var(--text, #e8e0d0); }
.pcs .pcs-foot { font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-muted, #8a8070); margin: 0.5rem 0 0; }
.pcs .pcs-foot a { color: var(--amber, #e09422); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-style: dotted; text-underline-offset: 2px; white-space: nowrap; }
.pcs .pcs-stress { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem 0.5rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; font-size: 0.76rem; }
.pcs .pcs-stress-lbl { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size: 0.64rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted, #8a8070); }
.pcs .pcs-chip { font: inherit; font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-dim, #a89f8f); background: transparent; border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.22); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.22rem 0.65rem; margin: 0; cursor: pointer; }
.pcs .pcs-chip:hover { border-color: rgba(224,148,34,0.55); }
.pcs .pcs-chip.active { color: var(--amber, #e09422); border-style: solid; border-color: var(--amber, #e09422); background: rgba(224,148,34,0.08); }
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pcs .pcs-eyebrow { display: block; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }
  .pcs .pcs-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .pcs .pcs-or { padding: 0; }
}
</style>
<div class="pcs{% if pcs_class %} {{ pcs_class }}{% endif %}" id="{{ pcsId }}">
  <p class="pcs-head"><span class="pcs-eyebrow">Bitcoin&rsquo;s price &middot; two scenarios to consider</span><span data-pcs="lead">Neither scenario is a forecast.</span></p>
  <div class="pcs-row" role="group" aria-label="Bitcoin&rsquo;s price: two scenarios to consider">
    <button type="button" class="pc-opt pcs-opt active" data-scenario="stay" aria-pressed="true">
      <span class="pcs-top"><span class="pcs-tag pcs-tag--cons" data-pcs="tag">Conservative</span><span class="pcs-state"><span class="pcs-state-on">&check; Showing</span><span class="pcs-state-off">Show this scenario</span></span></span>
      <span class="pcs-title" data-pcs="title">If bitcoin stays where it is against trend</span>
      <span class="pcs-note" data-pcs="note"></span>
    </button>
    <span class="pcs-or" aria-hidden="true">or</span>
    <button type="button" class="pc-opt pcs-opt" data-scenario="trend" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="pcs-top"><span class="pcs-tag pcs-tag--hist" data-pcs="tag">Historical pattern</span><span class="pcs-state"><span class="pcs-state-on">&check; Showing</span><span class="pcs-state-off">Show this scenario</span></span></span>
      <span class="pcs-title" data-pcs="title">If bitcoin returns to trend over 3 years</span>
      <span class="pcs-note" data-pcs="note"></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <p class="pcs-other" data-pcs="other" hidden></p>
  <div class="pcs-stress">
    <span class="pcs-stress-lbl">Stress test</span>
    <button type="button" class="pc-opt pcs-chip" data-scenario="floor" aria-pressed="false">Falls to the floor (0.42&times;) and stays</button>
  </div>
  <p class="pcs-foot"><span data-pcs="foot"></span> <a href="/discount-or-premium#dpDuration">How long returns to trend have taken&nbsp;&rarr;</a></p>
</div>
